<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise des Eaux 97 Q1 sales up 3.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise des Eaux 97 Q1 sales up 3.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover		     22.34     vs   21.67</p>
<p>    - Environmental services	    12.78     vs   12.39</p>
<p>    - water supply			   5.22     vs    5.02</p>
<p>    - water treatment			1.05     vs    1.05</p>
<p>    - cleaning services		    2.50     vs    2.39</p>
<p>    - energy				   3.63     vs    3.59</p>
<p>    - Communications			 0.44     vs    0.36</p>
<p>    - Construction			   8.84     vs    8.52</p>
<p>    - Other				    0.28     vs    0.40</p>
<p>NOTE -- Lyonnaise des Eaux gave the figures in a table.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
